  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved Management and Transparency of Mining Sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the activity is to build capacity of the Guinean Government and key stakeholders to improve governance and transparency in the management of the country&apos;s mineral resources in a participatory way. This would be achieved through the strengthening of Government&apos;s ability to negotiate stable and fair investment agreements, that contribute to economic development at the national, regional and local levels; and through the development of a sound and transparent revenue management framework. This would contribute to a better distribution of benefits among the Guinean population and would help in the fight against poverty. transparency in the management of the country#s mineral resources in a participatory way. This would be achieved through the strengthening of Government#s ability to negotiate stable and fair investment agreements that contribute to economic development at the national, regional and local levels; and through the development of a sound and transparent revenue management framework.  This would contribute to a better distribution of benefits among the Guinean population and would help in the fight against poverty.</narrative>
  </description>
